strings.en:
{1c:11}{0b:08}【 Priest Tiara 】{0b:09}
What Saint Barkail said... To be honest, it
has shaken me...{0c:f7015cfe}

{0c:51010c1e52090156}{1c:11}{0b:08}【 Priest Tiara 】{0b:09}
I was praying for all of you.{1a}That Fatum-san and Nada-san may
awaken, and that you and the others
may return safely, {10}-san...{1a}Perhaps now we cannot even believe in
the God we offer prayers to, but this is
about all I can do...{0c:f7015efe}

{1c:10}Oh, about me?{1a}I am not good at talking about myself, so
I do not know what to say...{1a}Besides, you would find nothing
interesting in hearing about me.{0c:02ed01}
